        "TileImage": "$($repository c98ea7f1-0271-47d9-822f-97bf52657cda).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47. \rYour target is Mikhail Kadir, a &apos;Providence&apos; herald and operative, currently visiting Don Yates retirement party. Kadir is the informant of &apos;Providence&apos;, investigating all suspicious incidents. He is called to check informations, but rather, gather them. In order to prevent &apos;Providence&apos; from ever forming again, we need to stop the informations coming to them, making Kadir a target. \rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages. \rGood luck 47. \rMission status: ACTIVE",
